 are? Join Boston-area author Carlton Champian for a reading and discussion
  of his book\, Notes to My Father\, a deeply personal exploration of fathe
 rhood\, abandonment\, identity\, and the journey of confronting what we in
 herit.\nhttps://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6aaac1cc6074830038275609\nFro
