SUMMARY:Rescheduled 2026 MIT Great Glass Pumpkin Patch
LOCATION:MIT\, 77 Massachusetts Avenue\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:Originally scheduled for Saturday 9/26\, and now rescheduled fo
 r Saturday 10/24\, the 25th annual MIT Great Glass Pumpkin Patch offers gl
 ass pumpkins of all colors\, shapes and sizes for sale to the general publ
 ic. Proceeds from this event fund the ongoing operations of the MIT Glass 
